  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "12:21 P.M.\nRuins of Chernobog 'District 14'\nSector Surface"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "What the hell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yeti Squad, why have you stopped firing? What are you waiting for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "...Dig out those ruins, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Didn't you plant the Originium? Why not collapse the whole plate and wipe out Rhodes Island all at once?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Are you kidding? FrostNova is still down there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Then we'll deal with Rhodes Island. You guys keep digging. We'll be right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Not on this block! The superstructure in this sector is completely shredded. An untrained team fighting here could induce a total collapse!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Wiping out Rhodes Island is a top priority. You take care of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'm not gonna argue with you. We'll fight what we gotta fight. Who decided on this priority anyway?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's obviously our most important strategic goal."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Were you thinking about strategic goals when you vented your anger on the Ursus?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We'll do what we can. Give us some space."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Did you... communicate with Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You're betraying the Movement!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "(What's going on over there?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(I think we have to fight.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If you think communication is tantamount to betrayal then that's your prerogative."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "With that kind of tactical thinking, it's no wonder you're getting led around by the nose."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "...Yetis! What are you up to?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "We outnumber you a hundred times over, don't be stupid!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "...Come on, we fought the Ursus Standing Army like a million times, who's getting excited over a big angry mob?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Caster",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Just you wait!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "(Static)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Hey, Rhodes Island. We might have to teach those unruly bastards a lesson."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "You should probably stay out of it. We don't want to be accused of collaborating with the enemy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Huh? Collaborating? What are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Amiya, what happened in the ruins, and what's the official party line on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......Nothing happened. We were fighting Yeti Squad and no other Reunion units joined the battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Acting? I'm a phenomenal actress."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "What do you say we put on a show and then take care of these guys in the ensuing chaos?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Sounds good to me. What does your captain think?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Excuse me, sir. How should I call you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "...Um, well, you're a really cute girl, but I'm not sure I'm ready for anything like that..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ready for what? What are you thinking?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Oh, sorry. I'm just playing around. You can call me Yeti #1, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "All right, Mr. Yeti #1... We've got lives to save, don't we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "So let's subdue the Reunion units that could interfere with our rescue mission."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mr. Yeti #1",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Yeah. I'm plenty motivated now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "...And where exactly did you get that motivation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
